.\\n5. Based on its form and position, it functions as a pendant or a large choker.\\n\\nThe object on her necklace is a circular pendant.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, the woman is wearing a high-necked top. The pattern on this top appears to be a continuous, detailed texture, possibly resembling scales or lace, rather than a distinct, separate piece of jewelry like a necklace with a specific pendant or charm. Therefore, there is no separate shape on a necklace visible in the image.\\n\\nThe shape is part of the top's design.\", \"Upon examining the image, the woman is wearing a high-necked garment. There is no visible necklace on her neck or chest area. Therefore, it is not possible to identify the shape of a necklace.\\n\\nNot present in the image.\"]", "time_sec": 67.324, "generation_time_seconds": 67.1493, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [49284, 37836, 279, 2168, 11, 279, 5220, 374, 12233, 264, 54447, 13, 576, 41744, 315, 419, 54447, 374, 264, 3175, 11, 20469, 6573, 13, 1096, 6573, 374, 537, 264, 8606, 8781, 476, 5248, 54208, 11, 714, 4751, 264, 6437, 11, 26765, 291, 2392, 429, 7952, 311, 387, 1865, 315, 279, 1852, 3684, 323, 1894, 438, 279, 2732, 315, 1059, 27303, 382, 1986, 41744, 702, 264, 12460, 323, 6351, 6083, 13, 1084, 646, 387, 7481, 438, 264, 52484, 11, 3463, 24481, 11, 476, 63468, 482, 1352, 13, 1084, 1558, 537, 51180, 264, 4285, 25366, 11, 12671, 11, 476, 4746, 13, 12090, 11, 432, 374, 458, 56116, 11, 7299, 2220, 580, 24481, 5944, 429, 7952, 311, 387, 264, 6573, 315, 30717, 304, 1181, 1828, 1290, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.942, -0.1454, -0.0002, -0.3102, -0.003, -0.1371, -0.1393, -0.0341, -0.0105, -0.005, -0.6242, -0.8578, -0.1233, -0.586, -0.8737, -0.361, -0.0, -0.0958, -0.301, -2.5356, -0.0009, -2.8064, -2.4811, -0.1411, -0.7766, -0.0039, -0.212, -2.5062, -0.0658, -1.6454, -1.3196, -0.9652, -1.8919, -0.5698, -0.4942, -0.0001, -0.1228, -0.0327, -0.7085, -0