{"id": "91", "question": "What color are the outside of the dragon's eyes?", "gt": "The outside of the dragon's eyes are blue.", "pred": "In the image, the dragon has large, prominent eyes. The outer part of the eye, specifically the sclera or the skin surrounding the iris, is a distinct red color. The iris itself appears to be a dark purple or grey, but the question specifically asks about the outside, which is red.\n\nThe color of the outside of the dragon's eyes is red.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In the image, the dragon has large, prominent eyes. The outer part of the eye, specifically the sclera or the skin surrounding the iris, is a distinct red color. The iris itself appears to be a dark purple or grey, but the question specifically asks about the outside, which is red.\n\nThe color of the outside of the dragon's eyes is red.", "cot": "[\"In the image, the dragon has large, prominent eyes. The outer part of the eye, specifically the sclera or the skin surrounding the iris, is a distinct red color. The iris itself appears to be a dark purple or grey, but the question specifically asks about the outside, which is red.\\n\\nThe color of the outside of the dragon's eyes is red.\", \"1. The image displays a white dragon with a young girl.\\n2. The dragon's eyes are visible on its head.\\n3. The outer part of the dragon's eyes, specifically the sclera or the area surrounding the pupils, is colored red.\\n4. This red color contrasts with the white scales of the dragon's body and the blue of the background.\\nTherefore, based on the visual information provided in the image, the outside of the dragon's eyes is red.\\n\\nFinal Answer: Red.\", \"Looking at the image, the dragon has two distinct eyes. The parts of the eyes that are visible on the outside, including the sclera and the area around the pupil, are white. The pupil itself is red.\\n\\nTherefore, the color o