{"id": "94", "question": "How many buttons are on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image?", "gt": "There are three buttons on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image.", "pred": "Let's examine the jacket worn by the figure in the foreground. On the left side of the jacket, we can see a vertical row of four distinct buttons. On the right side of the jacket, there is also a vertical row of four distinct buttons. Counting the buttons on both sides gives us a total of 4 + 4 = 8 buttons.\n\nTherefore, there are 8 buttons on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Let's examine the jacket worn by the figure in the foreground. On the left side of the jacket, we can see a vertical row of four distinct buttons. On the right side of the jacket, there is also a vertical row of four distinct buttons. Counting the buttons on both sides gives us a total of 4 + 4 = 8 buttons.\n\nTherefore, there are 8 buttons on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image.", "cot": "[\"Let's examine the jacket worn by the figure in the foreground. On the left side of the jacket, we can see a vertical row of four distinct buttons. On the right side of the jacket, there is also a vertical row of four distinct buttons. Counting the buttons on both sides gives us a total of 4 + 4 = 8 buttons.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 8 buttons on the jacket of the person at the forefront of the image.\", \"Let's examine the jacket of the person in the foreground of the image.\\n\\n1.  The person is wearing a blue jacket with a visible button placket down the front.\\n2.  By counting the buttons on this placket, we can see there are three buttons arranged vertically.\\n3.  There is also a small, four-pointed star-shaped badge on the left side of the chest, but this is not a button for fastening the jacket.\\n\\nTherefore, there are t