{"id": "105", "question": "How many pairs of sunglasses are visible in the image?", "gt": "There are three visible pairs of sunglasses in the image.", "pred": "2", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Let's analyze the image step by step:\n\n1.  We need to count the number of pairs of sunglasses.\n2.  A pair consists of two sunglasses.\n3.  In the image, we can clearly see two men wearing sunglasses:\n    *   The man in the black leather jacket on the left.\n    *   The man in the blue suit in the center.\n4.  Looking closely, we can see that the man in the black jacket is wearing one pair (two sunglasses). The man in the blue suit is also wearing one pair (two sunglasses).\n5.  There are no other individuals in the image who are visibly wearing sunglasses.\n\nTherefore, there are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.\n\nAnswer: 2", "cot": "[\"Let's analyze the image step by step:\\n\\n1.  We need to count the number of pairs of sunglasses.\\n2.  A pair consists of two sunglasses.\\n3.  In the image, we can clearly see two men wearing sunglasses:\\n    *   The man in the black leather jacket on the left.\\n    *   The man in the blue suit in the center.\\n4.  Looking closely, we can see that the man in the black jacket is wearing one pair (two sunglasses). The man in the blue suit is also wearing one pair (two sunglasses).\\n5.  There are no other individuals in the image who are visibly wearing sunglasses.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two pairs of sunglasses visible in the image.\\n\\nAnswer: 2\", \"I will now analyze the image to count the number of pairs of sunglasses.\\n\\n1.  **Identify individuals wearing sunglasses:**\\n    *   On the far left, a man is wearing sunglasses.\\n    *   In the center, the man in the blue suit is wearing sunglasses.\\n    *   On the right, the man in the black suit with a red shirt is wearing sunglasses.\\n    *   In the background, another man can be seen wearing sunglasses.\\n\\n2.  **Count the pairs:**\\n    *   Each of these four individuals is wearing one pair of sunglasses.\\n    *   Therefore, there are a total of four pairs of sunglasses visible.\\n\\nThe final answer is 4.\", \"1. The man on the far left is wearing sunglasses.\\n2. The man in the center is wearing sunglasses.\\n3. The man on the far right is wearing sunglasses.\\n4. The man in the black jacket on the far right is not wearing sunglasses.\\nTherefore, there are 3 pairs of sunglasses visible.\\n\\nFinal Answer: 3\", \"Upon reviewing the image, we can identify the following:\\n- The man in the blue suit and the man in the black leather jacket are both wearing sunglasses.\\n- The other individuals in the image are not wearing sunglasses.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two pairs of sunglasses visible.\"]", "time_sec": 78.637, "generation_time_seconds": 78.3988, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [10061, 594, 23643, 279, 2168, 3019, 553, 3019, 1447, 16, 13, 220, 1205, 1184, 311, 1760, 279, 1372, 315, 13530, 315, 59369, 624, 17, 13, 220, 362, 6716, 17167, 315, 1378, 59369, 624, 18, 13, 220, 758, 279, 2168, 11, 582, 646, 9355, 1490, 1378, 2953, 12233, 59369, 510, 262, 353, 256, 576, 883, 304, 279, 3691, 17553, 26208, 389, 279, 2115, 624, 262, 353, 256, 576, 883, 304, 279, 6303, 7781, 304, 279, 4126, 624, 19, 13, 220, 21131, 15148, 11, 582, 646, 1490, 429, 279, 883, 304, 279, 3691, 26208, 374, 12233, 825, 6716, 320, 19789, 59369, 568, 576, 883, 304, 279, 6303, 7781, 374, 1083, 12233, 825, 6716, 320, 19789, 59369, 4292, 20, 13, 220, 2619, 525, 902, 1008, 7775, 304, 279, 2168, 879, 525, 73006, 12233, 59369, 382, 54815, 11, 1052, 525, 1378, 13530, 315, 59369, 9434, 304, 279, 2168, 382, 16141, 25, 220, 17, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.9881, -0.0001, -0.4849, -0.0, -0.0072, -2.4001, -0.0067, 0.0, -0.1486, -0.0037, -0.0, -0.5354, -1.5009, -0.6748, 0.0, -0.425, -0.0016, -0.0637,