{"id": "108", "question": "How many astronauts are present in this image?", "gt": "There are two astronauts present.", "pred": "Therefore, there are two astronauts present in this image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the image provided, we can observe the following:\n\n1.  There is a large rocket launching into the sky, with a significant amount of smoke and fire at its base.\n2.  In the foreground, on a dirt path, there are two figures dressed in full white astronaut suits.\n3.  One astronaut is closer to the viewer and appears to be walking along the path.\n4.  A second astronaut is further down the path, also walking away from the viewer.\n5.  No other figures in astronaut suits are visible elsewhere in the image.\n\nTherefore, there are two astronauts present in this image.", "cot": "[\"Based on the image provided, we can observe the following:\\n\\n1.  There is a large rocket launching into the sky, with a significant amount of smoke and fire at its base.\\n2.  In the foreground, on a dirt path, there are two figures dressed in full white astronaut suits.\\n3.  One astronaut is closer to the viewer and appears to be walking along the path.\\n4.  A second astronaut is further down the path, also walking away from the viewer.\\n5.  No other figures in astronaut suits are visible elsewhere in the image.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two astronauts present in this image.\", \"There are two astronauts visible in the image. One is walking on a path in the foreground, and another is further back, also walking on the path.\", \"There are two astronauts visible in the image. One is positioned further back on the path, and the other is closer to the foreground.\", \"Let's analyze the image to determine the number of astronauts present.\\n\\n- In the foreground, on a dirt path, we can see two figures dressed in white spacesuits.\\n- One figure is closer to the viewer, walking towards the center of the image.\\n- A second figure is further down the path, walking away from the viewer.\\n- Both figures have the distinct appearance of astronauts.\\n\\nBased on these observations, there are two astronauts in the image.\\n\\nFinal answer: 2\"]", "time_sec": 56.781, "generation_time_seconds": 56.618, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"rollout": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 2168, 3897, 11, 582, 646, 22986, 279, 2701, 1447, 16, 13, 220, 2619, 374, 264, 3460, 24306, 27718, 1119, 279, 12884, 11, 448, 264, 5089, 3311, 315, 16205, 323, 3940, 518, 1181, 2331, 624, 17, 13, 220, 758, 279, 39305, 11, 389, 264, 25284, 1815, 11, 1052, 525, 1378, 12396, 25365, 304, 2480, 4158, 46633, 27976, 624, 18, 13, 220, 3776, 46633, 374, 12128, 311, 279, 25708, 323, 7952, 311, 387, 11435, 3156, 279, 1815, 624, 19, 13, 220, 362, 2086, 46633, 374, 4623, 1495, 279, 1815, 11, 1083, 11435, 3123, 504, 279, 25708, 624, 20, 13, 220, 2308, 1008, 12396, 304, 46633, 27976, 525, 9434, 17920, 304, 279, 2168, 382, 54815, 11, 1052, 525, 1378, 68422, 3042, 304, 419, 2168, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.2918, -0.0001, -0.303, -0.8056, -0.3024, -0.0224, -0.3255, -0.0, -0.2974, -0.2148, -0.0004, -0.1629, -1.0661, -0.0, -0.1429, -0.9987, -0.2519, -0.3234, -0.7501, -0.0398, -0.4054, -0.0619, -0.1767, -0.0002, -0.8592, -0.8473, -0.3907, -0.1669, -0.0664, 0.0, -0.009, -0.0239, -0.313, -0.0534, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0115, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0536, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0218, -0.4424, -0.0136, -0.3955, -0.0002, -0.5008, -0.5079, -0.0055, -0.0116, -0.0319, -0.3572, -0.0019, -2.2349, -0.2047, -0.9787, -0.0036, -0.0237, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.1747, -0.0056, -0.0024, -1.2201, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0497, -2.5819, -0.0294, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.007, -3.8166, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0026, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.27, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0299, -0.7742, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0355, -0.2596, -0.0374, -2.0516, -0.0024, -0.0, -0.0035, -3.7843, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.1984, -0.0, -0.5458, -1.3922, -0.082