 is below the purple one.\\n- There is also a yellow balloon near the center of the cluster.\\n\\nCounting each of these individual balloons, we arrive at a total of 10.\\n\\nTherefore, the woman is holding 10 balloons.\", \"I have carefully examined the image to count the number of balloons the woman is holding.\\n\\nBy observing the cluster of balloons in her hand, I can count them individually:\\n- There is one large green balloon on the far left.\\n- Next to it is a red balloon.\\n- Then a yellow balloon.\\n- A light blue balloon.\\n- A pink balloon.\\n- An orange balloon.\\n- A dark green balloon.\\n- A smaller red balloon.\\n- A smaller yellow balloon.\\n- A small pink balloon.\\n- A small orange balloon.\\n- And a very small blue balloon at the bottom.\\n\\nCounting each balloon in the cluster results in a total of 12 balloons.\\n\\n12\", \"By carefully counting the individual balloons in the cluster the woman is holding, we can identify each one. The cluster contains the following balloons: 1 red, 1 yellow, 1 light blue, 1 dark blue, 1 light green, 1 dark green, 1 orange, 1 pink, 1 pale green, 1 dark pink, 1 light pink, 1 white, and 1 dark red. Counting each of these individual balloons results in a total of 13.\\n\\nTherefore, the woman is holding 13 balloons.\"]", "time_sec": 99.167, "generation_time_seconds": 98.9871, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
