{"id": "306", "question": "The star at the top of the Christmas tree is gold or silver?", "gt": "It is a gold star at the top of the tree ; There is a gold star atop the Christmas tree ; There is a bright gold star at the top of the Christmas tree", "pred": "Based on the image, the star at the top of the Christmas tree has a distinct golden or yellowish hue, indicating it is gold.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the image, the star at the top of the Christmas tree has a distinct golden or yellowish hue, indicating it is gold.", "cot": "[\"Based on the image, the star at the top of the Christmas tree has a distinct golden or yellowish hue, indicating it is gold.\", \"Based on the visual information provided, the star at the top of the Christmas tree has a distinct golden or yellowish hue, consistent with a gold color.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, the star at the top of the Christmas tree has a distinct warm, glowing yellow color. This color is consistent with gold, rather than the cooler, more reflective quality of silver. The light from the star appears to be integrated into the overall warm lighting of the scene.\\n\\nTherefore, the star at the top of the Christmas tree is gold.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, the star at the top of the Christmas tree is illuminated with a bright, warm light. This golden glow is consistent with the overall warm lighting of the church and the golden hues of the candles and chandeliers. Therefore, the star appears to be gold in color.\\n\\nGold\"]", "time_sec": 43.174, "generation_time_seconds": 42.9912, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
