otal of 4 UFOs in the sky.\", \"Based on a careful examination of the image, we can identify the following objects in the sky:\\n\\n1.  There is one very large, prominent UFO in the upper center of the image, which is the main focus.\\n2.  To the right of the main UFO, a second, smaller, and more distant UFO can be seen.\\n3.  To the far left of the main UFO, a third, even smaller UFO is visible.\\n\\nThese three objects are the only ones that resemble unidentified flying objects.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 3 UFOs in the sky.\", \"Based on the image, there is one large, prominent UFO in the foreground. There is also a second, smaller UFO visible in the background on the right side of the image. Therefore, there are a total of 2 UFOs.\"]", "time_sec": 75.11, "generation_time_seconds": 74.9424, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
