{"id": "322", "question": "What color is the bird in the image?", "gt": "The bird is red ; Red ; The bird in the image is red", "pred": "The bird in the image has glowing red and orange feathers, with a fiery appearance overall.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The bird in the image has glowing red and orange feathers, with a fiery appearance overall.", "cot": "[\"The bird in the image has glowing red and orange feathers, with a fiery appearance overall.\", \"The bird in the image has predominantly red and orange feathers. Its body and wings exhibit shades of red, with a fiery, glowing appearance, particularly along the edges of the wings and tail.\\n\\nFinal Answer: The bird is red.\", \"The bird in the image has a vibrant, fiery coloration. Its feathers are primarily red with glowing orange and yellow highlights, giving it an appearance as if it is on fire or made of embers. The overall color can be described as red and orange.\", \"Based on the image provided, the bird is predominantly red. Its feathers are illuminated with a bright, fiery red glow, giving it a luminous appearance. There are also some darker, almost black or deep brown, accents on its body and wings. Therefore, the most accurate description of its color is red.\"]", "time_sec": 39.896, "generation_time_seconds": 39.7178, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "326", "question": "What is the woman taking a picture of?", "gt": "She is taking a picture of pink flowers; Pink flowers; The woman is taking a picture of pink flowers", "pred": "Based on the image provided, the woman is holding a camera up to her eye and aiming it forward. The view through the camera's lens is not visible, so it is impossible to determine what she is photographing. The image only shows her in the act of taking a picture.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the image provided, the woman is holding a camera up to her eye and aiming it forward. The view through the camera's lens is not visible, so it is impossible to determine what she is photographing. The image only shows her in the act of taking a picture.", "cot": "[\"Based on the image provided, the woman is holding a camera up to her eye and aiming it forward. The view through the camera's lens is not visible, so it is impossible to determine what she is photographing. The image only shows her in the act of taking a picture.\", \"The woman is holding a camera and pointing it towards a cluster of pink flowers and green leaves that are visible in the foreground of the image.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, we can observe the following:\\n\\n1.  The woman is holding a camera with a lens that is pointed forward and slightly downward.\\n2.  In the immediate foreground, there is a plant with pink flowers and green leaves.\\n3.  The woman's hands and the camera are very close to this plant, and the lens is aimed directly at it.\\n4.  The background is out of focus, suggesting the camera is focused on a subject in the foreground.\\n\\nGiven that the plant is in the foreground and the camera is pointed at it, it is the most likely subject she is photographing.\\n\\nThe woman is taking a picture of the plant with pink flowers.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, the woman is holding her camera up to her eye, with the lens pointed forward. This posture indicates she is actively taking a photograph. The viewfinder and lens are aimed towards the flowers that are located directly in front of her, which are the subject of the picture she is capturing.\"]", "time_sec": 57.951, "generation_time_seconds": 57.7916, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "328", "question": "How many blurred faces can be seen in this image?", "gt": "5; 5 faces ; 5 blurred faces can be seen", "pred": "Therefore, there are a total of 6 blurred faces visible in the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Upon observing the image, several figures of people can be seen walking on the street. Due to motion blur, their faces are indistinct and not clearly visible. Counting the individuals who appear to have blurred features, we can identify:\n\n*   Three people walking on the sidewalk in the foreground on the left side of the image.\n*   One person walking in front of the building's entrance.\n*   Two people walking on the sidewalk on the right side of the image.\n\nThe faces of all these individuals are blurred.\n\nTherefore, there are a total of 6 blurred faces visible in the image.", "cot": "[\"Upon observing the image, several figures of people can be seen walking on the street. Due to motion blur, their faces are indistinct and not clearly visible. Counting the individuals who appear to have blurred features, we can identify:\\n\\n*   Three people walking on the sidewalk in the foreground on the left side of the image.\\n*   One person walking in front of the building's entrance.\\n*   Two people walking on the sidewalk on the right side of the image.\\n\\nThe faces of all these individuals are blurred.\\n\\nTherefore, there are a total of 6 blurred faces visible in the image.\", \"Based on a careful examination of the image, the people walking on the street are depicted with motion blur. This effect obscures their features, making their faces indistinct and unrecognizable.\\n\\nThere are several people visible, but due to the blur, their faces are not clearly defined.\\n\\n- There is a group of three people on the left side of the image.\\n- There is a single person in the doorway of the red building.\\n- There are two people walking on the right side of the image.\\n\\nCounting these individuals, we can see five people in total, all of whom are blurred.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 5 blurred figures, and thus, 5 blurred faces can be seen in the image.\", \"Upon examining the image, we can identify the following individuals:\\n\\n- On the left side, there are two people walking together. Their faces are not clearly visible and appear blurred due to motion.\\n- In the center, there is one person standing near the entrance. This person's face is also not clearly visible.\\n- On the right side, there are two people walking. Their faces are similarly blurred.\\n\\nIn total, there are five people whose faces are blurred in the image.\\n\\nAnswer: 5\", \"Upon examining the image, we can identify several people who are blurred. These individuals are located on the street, near the building. Their motion has caused them to appear as streaks or blurs.\\n\\nBy carefully observing the scene, we can count the distinct blurred figures:\\n- On the left side of the image, there are two blurred figures walking together.\\n- On the right side of the image, there are two more blurred figures walking together.\\n\\nIn total, there are four blurred figures visible in the image.\\n\\nTherefore, the number of blurred faces that can be seen is 4.\"]", "time_sec": 87.783, "generation_time_seconds": 87.6196, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 25.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "329", "question": "How many chimneys are visible in the image?", "gt": "Three; There are three chimneys; I can see three chimneys on top of the house", "pred": "Upon examining the roof of the house in the image, two distinct chimneys can be seen protruding from the roofline. One is on the left side, and the other is on the right side of the house.\n\nTherefore, there are 2 chimneys visible in the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Upon examining the roof of the house in the image, two distinct chimneys can be seen protruding from the roofline. One is on the left side, and the other is on the right side of the house.\n\nTherefore, there are 2 chimneys visible in the image.", "cot": "[\"Upon examining the roof of the house in the image, two distinct chimneys can be seen protruding from the roofline. One is on the left side, and the other is on the right side of the house.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 2 chimneys visible in the image.\", \"I am analyzing the image to identify the number of chimneys. The house visible in the image has a roof with a gabled structure. On the right side of the house, a single red chimney is clearly visible protruding from the roof. No other chimneys can be seen on the left side or any other part of the roof. Therefore, there is only one chimney visible in the image.\\n\\nFinal Answer: There is 1 chimney visible in the image.\", \"There is one chimney visible on the roof of the house in the image.\", \"I have analyzed the image to count the visible chimneys.\\n\\n- On the roof of the house, there are two distinct, light-colored structures protruding upwards.\\n- These structures are consistent in shape and appearance with chimneys.\\n- No other chimneys can be seen on the house or anywhere else in the image.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two chimneys visible.\"]", "time_sec": 49.34, "generation_time_seconds": 49.1746, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "330", "question": "How many flying saucers are seen in this image?", "gt": "There are three flying saucers; Three flying saucers are seen in this image; Three flying saucers are pictured", "pred": "Based on the image provided:\n\n1.  There is one large, primary flying saucer (UFO) prominently featured in the sky above the house.\n2.  There are several smaller, less distinct, circular shapes in the sky behind the main UFO. These appear to be part of the same fleet or formation.\n\nCounting the distinct flying saucers, there is one large one and at least three smaller ones visible.\n\nTherefore, a total of four flying saucers can be seen in the image.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the image provided:\n\n1.  There is one large, primary flying saucer (UFO) prominently featured in the sky above the house.\n2.  There are several smaller, less distinct, circular shapes in the sky behind the main UFO. These appear to be part of the same fleet or formation.\n\nCounting the distinct flying saucers, there is one large one and at least three smaller ones visible.\n\nTherefore, a total of four flying saucers can be seen in the image.", "cot": "[\"Based on the image provided:\\n\\n1.  There is one large, primary flying saucer (UFO) prominently featured in the sky above the house.\\n2.  There are several smaller, less distinct, circular shapes in the sky behind the main UFO. These appear to be part of the same fleet or formation.\\n\\nCounting the distinct flying saucers, there is one large one and at least three smaller ones visible.\\n\\nTherefore, a total of four flying saucers can be seen in the image.\", \"Let's analyze the image to identify the flying saucers:\\n\\n1.  **Foreground:** There is one large, prominent flying saucer in the upper left of the sky. It has a distinct disc shape and a glowing underside.\\n2.  **Background:** Further in the distance, partially obscured by clouds, there appear to be two smaller, similar objects. They have the same disc-like shape and are aligned in a diagonal line, suggesting a formation.\\n\\nBy counting each distinct object that matches the description of a flying saucer, we can determine the total number.\\n\\nThere are 3 flying saucers in the image.\", \"Based on the image, there is one large, prominent flying saucer in the sky above the house. There are also several smaller, fainter lights in the clouds behind it, but only one distinct flying saucer is clearly visible.\", \"Based on the image provided, we can identify the following:\\n- There is one large, prominent flying saucer hovering over the house.\\n- There is a second, much smaller flying saucer visible in the sky to the left of the main one.\\n\\nTherefore, there are a total of two flying saucers in the image.\\nFinal answer: 2\"]", "time_sec": 66.555, "generation_time_seconds": 66.3965, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.62, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "331", "question": "How many candles are in the cake?", "gt": "Three; There are three candles ; Three candles are on the cake", "pred": "1. Observe the cake in the image.\n2. Count the number of candles stuck in the cake.\n3. There are three candles on the cake.\n\nTherefore, there are 3 candles in the cake.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. Observe the cake in the image.\n2. Count the number of candles stuck in the cake.\n3. There are three candles on the cake.\n\nTherefore, there are 3 candles in the cake.", "cot": "[\"1. Observe the cake in the image.\\n2. Count the number of candles stuck in the cake.\\n3. There are three candles on the cake.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 3 candles in the cake.\", \"Upon examining the image, we can see a cake with candles placed on it. Counting the individual candles, there are four distinct flames visible.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 4 candles on the cake.\", \"Observing the cake in the image, we can see three candles placed in the center. They are lit and have flames on top.\\nTherefore, there are 3 candles in the cake.\", \"1. The image displays a birthday cake held by two people.\\n2. On top of the cake, there are several lit candles.\\n3. By counting the visible candles, we can see there are 5 in total.\\nTherefore, there are 5 candles in the cake.\"]", "time_sec": 39.746, "generation_time_seconds": 39.5845, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "333", "question": "Is the person's chain necklace in this image silver or gold?", "gt": "The person is wearing a gold chain necklace ; The person's necklace is gold in this image ; It is gold", "pred": "gold", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image displays a person wearing a chain necklace.\n2. The necklace has a yellowish metallic hue, which is characteristic of gold.\n3. There are no visual indicators of a silver color, such as a cool, grayish tone.\n4. Therefore, based on the visual information, the chain necklace is gold.\n\nFinal Answer: gold", "cot": "[\"1. The image displays a person wearing a chain necklace.\\n2. The necklace has a yellowish metallic hue, which is characteristic of gold.\\n3. There are no visual indicators of a silver color, such as a cool, grayish tone.\\n4. Therefore, based on the visual information, the chain necklace is gold.\\n\\nFinal Answer: gold\", \"Based on the visual information provided in the image:\\n\\n1.  The person is wearing a chain necklace.\\n2.  The color of the chain appears to be a light, yellowish tone, which is characteristic of gold.\\n3.  It does not have the duller, silvery-white hue typical of silver.\\n\\nTherefore, the chain necklace is gold.\", \"The necklace visible in the image has a yellowish metallic sheen, consistent with the appearance of gold.\", \"Upon inspecting the image, the person is wearing a chain necklace. The color of this chain is clearly gold.\"]", "time_sec": 41.455, "generation_time_seconds": 41.29, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "334", "question": "What color is the largest butterfly?", "gt": "Blue; The largest butterfly is blue; The butterfly is blue", "pred": "1. The image contains multiple butterflies.\n2. Observing the butterflies, one is significantly larger than the others.\n3. This largest butterfly, located on the person's chest, has bright blue wings with black edges.\n\nTherefore, the largest butterfly is blue.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image contains multiple butterflies.\n2. Observing the butterflies, one is significantly larger than the others.\n3. This largest butterfly, located on the person's chest, has bright blue wings with black edges.\n\nTherefore, the largest butterfly is blue.", "cot": "[\"1. The image contains multiple butterflies.\\n2. Observing the butterflies, one is significantly larger than the others.\\n3. This largest butterfly, located on the person's chest, has bright blue wings with black edges.\\n\\nTherefore, the largest butterfly is blue.\", \"Observing the image, there are two butterflies. One is smaller and grey, and the other is significantly larger. The larger butterfly has wings that are a vibrant blue color with black markings and white spots along the edges.\\n\\nTherefore, the color of the largest butterfly is blue.\", \"The largest butterfly in the image is located on the right side of the person's head and body. Observing its wings, the dominant color is a vibrant blue. Therefore, the color of the largest butterfly is blue.\\nFinal Answer: Blue\", \"Based on the image, there are two butterflies. The butterfly on the right side of the image is larger than the one near the person's head. This larger butterfly has a distinct blue color on its wings, with black outlines and white spots along the edges.\\n\\nTherefore, the color of the largest butterfly is blue.\"]", "time_sec": 46.485, "generation_time_seconds": 46.3194, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "336", "question": "How many street lights can be seen in this image?", "gt": "There are two street lights; Two street lights are shown in this image; There are two street lights shown in this picture", "pred": "In the image, there are two distinct street lights visible. One is on the left side of the building, and another is on the right side of the building.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In the image, there are two distinct street lights visible. One is on the left side of the building, and another is on the right side of the building.", "cot": "[\"In the image, there are two distinct street lights visible. One is on the left side of the building, and another is on the right side of the building.\", \"Based on the image, we can count the visible street lights.\\n\\n- On the right side, there is one distinct street light close to the center of the image.\\n- On the left side, near the base of the building, there is another street light visible.\\n- Looking up the building on the left, there is a third street light mounted higher up.\\n\\nTherefore, there are a total of 3 street lights visible.\", \"There are two street lights visible in the image. One is located on the right side of the building, and another is further down the path, on the left side.\", \"By examining the image, we can identify the street lights by their distinct warm glow against the darker surroundings.\\n\\n-   On the left side of the image, next to the building, there is one street light visible.\\n-   Further down the path, another street light can be seen.\\n-   On the right side of the image, there is a third street light.\\n\\nTherefore, there are a total of three street lights visible in the image.\\n\\nFinal Answer: **3**\"]", "time_sec": 51.208, "generation_time_seconds": 51.0577, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.63, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc":