{"id": "339", "question": "How many dots are seen in the large alien’s eye?", "gt": "Two; Two dots; There are two dots", "pred": "2", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Observing the large alien's eye in the image, we can see two distinct dots.\n\n- One dot is larger and located towards the upper part of the eye. This is the reflection of the light source.\n- A second, smaller dot is visible near the lower part of the eye, also reflecting light.\n\nTherefore, there are two dots visible in the large alien's eye.\n\nFinal answer: 2", "cot": "[\"Observing the large alien's eye in the image, we can see two distinct dots.\\n\\n- One dot is larger and located towards the upper part of the eye. This is the reflection of the light source.\\n- A second, smaller dot is visible near the lower part of the eye, also reflecting light.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two dots visible in the large alien's eye.\\n\\nFinal answer: 2\", \"Let's analyze the image provided:\\n\\n1. **Identify the large alien's eye**: The image features a prominent, large alien figure. Its eye is the central focus.\\n2. **Observe the eye's contents**: The alien's eye is large and almond-shaped, colored blue. Within the blue iris, there is a prominent dark pupil.\\n3. **Count the dots**: Upon close inspection of the pupil, there is one distinct, small, bright white dot visible. This dot is typically used in art to represent a light source reflection, known as a specular highlight.\\n\\nTherefore, there is one dot visible in the large alien's eye.\\n\\nOne\", \"The large alien's eye contains one prominent dark pupil and one small white dot, which appears to be a reflection. Therefore, there is one distinct dot visible in the large alien's eye.\\n\\n1. Observe the large alien's eye in the image.\\n2. Identify the components within the eye.\\n3. Note the large dark pupil and the small white dot.\\n4. Count the number of distinct dots.\\n5. The white dot is the only additional dot visible.\\n\\nFinal answer: 1\", \"In the image, the large alien's eye contains one distinct dark dot, which represents the pupil. There are no other dots visible within the eye.\\n\\nTherefore, there is 1 dot in the large alien’s eye.\"]", "time_sec": 68.15, "generation_time_seconds": 67.9771, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "340", "question": "What color is the small alien?", "gt": "Pink; It is pink; The small alien is pink", "pred": "1. The image displays two figures in a desert-like landscape.\n2. The smaller figure is a child or young alien.\n3. Observing the color of its skin, it is a distinct pinkish hue.\nThe small alien is pink.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image displays two figures in a desert-like landscape.\n2. The smaller figure is a child or young alien.\n3. Observing the color of its skin, it is a distinct pinkish hue.\nThe small alien is pink.", "cot": "[\"1. The image displays two figures in a desert-like landscape.\\n2. The smaller figure is a child or young alien.\\n3. Observing the color of its skin, it is a distinct pinkish hue.\\nThe small alien is pink.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, the small alien figure has a pinkish or salmon-colored skin tone.\", \"The small alien is pink.\", \"1. The image displays two alien figures in a desert-like landscape.\\n2. The larger alien, on the right, has a grayish body and a large, dark eye.\\n3. The smaller alien, on the left, is standing and facing the larger one.\\n4. Observing the smaller alien's skin, its color appears to be pink or a light reddish-pink.\\nThe color of the small alien is pink.\"]", "time_sec": 37.977, "generation_time_seconds": 37.8132, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
