of the largest sphere in the image is orange.\", \"1. The image displays a scene with several spherical objects of varying sizes.\\n2. The largest of these spheres is located on the left side of the composition.\\n3. This sphere is a solid color, which can be described as orange or a light brownish-orange.\\n4. Therefore, the color of the largest sphere is orange.\"]", "time_sec": 52.348, "generation_time_seconds": 52.1988, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 27.27, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
