{"id": "344", "question": "How many birds can be seen flying around the sailboats?", "gt": "There are 4 birds flying around the sailboats ; 4 birds ; Four birds are seen flying around the sailboats", "pred": "1. The image shows a sailboat on the water with several birds flying in the sky above it.\n2. By carefully examining the sky area, specifically near the sailboat and the large sun, we can count the number of birds.\n3. There are 3 distinct birds visible in flight.\n\nTherefore, there are 3 birds flying around the sailboat.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image shows a sailboat on the water with several birds flying in the sky above it.\n2. By carefully examining the sky area, specifically near the sailboat and the large sun, we can count the number of birds.\n3. There are 3 distinct birds visible in flight.\n\nTherefore, there are 3 birds flying around the sailboat.", "cot": "[\"1. The image shows a sailboat on the water with several birds flying in the sky above it.\\n2. By carefully examining the sky area, specifically near the sailboat and the large sun, we can count the number of birds.\\n3. There are 3 distinct birds visible in flight.\\n\\nTherefore, there are 3 birds flying around the sailboat.\", \"Based on the image provided, there are three birds visible in the sky. They are all flying together in a V-formation above the sailboat.\", \"Based on the image provided, we can observe the scene around the sailboat on the water. There are three distinct birds depicted in flight near the sailboat and the setting sun. Therefore, there are 3 birds visible flying around the sailboat.\", \"In the image, there are three birds visible flying in the sky near the sailboat.\"]", "time_sec": 38.748, "generation_time_seconds": 38.5557, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 24.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "347", "question": "How many of the women wearing green dresses also have on necklaces?", "gt": "Two of the three women in green dresses are wearing necklaces; Three ladies are wearing green dresses, but only two of them have necklaces; two women; two", "pred": "One.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image displays two women wearing green dresses.\n2. The woman in the foreground, who is standing, is wearing a necklace.\n3. The other woman in a green dress is seated and is not wearing a necklace.\n4. Therefore, only one of the women wearing green dresses has a necklace.\n\nFinal answer: One.", "cot": "[\"1. The image displays two women wearing green dresses.\\n2. The woman in the foreground, who is standing, is wearing a necklace.\\n3. The other woman in a green dress is seated and is not wearing a necklace.\\n4. Therefore, only one of the women wearing green dresses has a necklace.\\n\\nFinal answer: One.\", \"There are two women wearing green dresses in the image. One is sitting at the table and is not wearing a necklace. The other is standing and is also not wearing a necklace. Therefore, neither of the women in green dresses is wearing a necklace.\\n\\nAnswer: 0\", \"1. First, I will locate the women wearing green dresses. There are two such women in the painting.\\n2. Next, I will examine the necks of both women to see if they are wearing necklaces.\\n3. The woman in the foreground, who is facing forward, is clearly wearing a necklace.\\n4. The other woman in a green dress is seen from the back and is not wearing a necklace.\\n5. Therefore, only one of the women wearing green dresses has a necklace.\\n\\nThe final answer is 1.\", \"Based on the image provided:\\n\\n1.  There are two women wearing green dresses. One is standing, and the other is seated at the table.\\n2.  The standing woman in the green dress is wearing a necklace.\\n3.  The seated woman in the green dress is not wearing a necklace; she has a high neckline on her dress.\\n\\nTherefore, only one of the women wearing green dresses has on a necklace.\\n\\nFinal Answer: 1\"]", "time_sec": 62.524, "generation_time_seconds": 62.361, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
