ion to determine the number of stories in the house.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, only the interior of a single room on one floor is visible. There are no elements, such as a staircase, multiple levels of windows, or a view of an upper floor, that would allow for a determination of the total number of stories in the house. Therefore, it is not possible to determine the number of stories from this image alone.\\n\\nNot present or visible.\", \"Based on the image provided, it is not possible to determine the total number of stories in the house. The photograph only shows the interior of one room on what appears to be a single floor. There is no visible exterior view, staircase, or any other architectural feature that would indicate the building's height or the presence of other floors. Therefore, the number of stories cannot be concluded from this image alone.\"]", "time_sec": 69.025, "generation_time_seconds": 68.8801, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
