{"id": "524", "question": "Is the car's gas tank more than half full or less than half full?", "gt": "It is full less than half; Less than a half; The car's gas thank is less than a half full", "pred": "Based on the visual content of the image, the gas tank is less than half full.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the visual content of the image, the gas tank is less than half full.", "cot": "[\"Based on the visual content of the image, the gas tank is less than half full.\", \"The fuel gauge needle is pointing slightly above the halfway mark on the tank indicator.\\n\\nTherefore, the car's gas tank is more than half full.\", \"I am unable to determine the car's gas tank level based on the provided image. The image does not show the car's gas tank or any fuel gauge, so I cannot assess whether it is more than half full or less than half full.\", \"Based on the visual content of the image, the fuel gauge is past the halfway mark. Therefore, the car's gas tank is more than half full.\"]", "time_sec": 30.105, "generation_time_seconds": 30.1036, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 40.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "525", "question": "What is the airline of this airplane?", "gt": "American Airline; It is Amercian Airline; The airline of this airplane is Amercian Airline", "pred": "1. The image displays an airplane with the name \"American\" written in a specific font on the side of its fuselage.\n2. The tail of the airplane features the \"American Airlines\" logo.\n3. The combination of the text and logo clearly identifies the airline.\nBased on these visual details, the airline of this airplane is American Airlines.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image displays an airplane with the name \"American\" written in a specific font on the side of its fuselage.\n2. The tail of the airplane features the \"American Airlines\" logo.\n3. The combination of the text and logo clearly identifies the airline.\nBased on these visual details, the airline of this airplane is American Airlines.", "cot": "[\"1. The image displays an airplane with the name \\\"American\\\" written in a specific font on the side of its fuselage.\\n2. The tail of the airplane features the \\\"American Airlines\\\" logo.\\n3. The combination of the text and logo clearly identifies the airline.\\nBased on these visual details, the airline of this airplane is American Airlines.\", \"Based on the visual information in the image, we can determine the airline of the airplane by examining its livery and branding.\\n\\n1.  **Text on the fuselage:** The name \\\"American\\\" is written in large, dark letters along the side of the aircraft's fuselage.\\n2.  **Logo on the tail:** The tail fin features a distinctive red and white design. This logo, a stylized set of wings, is the well-known branding for American Airlines.\\n\\nThese two elements together clearly identify the airline.\\n\\nThe airline of this airplane is American Airlines.\", \"1. The image shows a large passenger airplane on the tarmac.\\n2. The airline's name is written in large, white letters on the side of the fuselage.\\n3. The text clearly reads \\\"American\\\".\\n4. The airline's logo, a stylized red and white bird, is also visible on the tail fin.\\nBased on these visual cues, the airline is American Airlines.\\nfinal answer: American Airlines\", \"1. The airplane is parked on the tarmac near an airport terminal.\\n2. On the vertical stabilizer (tail fin), the words \\\"American Airlines\\\" are written in a distinct red script font.\\n3. The same name, \\\"American Airlines,\\\" is also written in red lettering along the side of the fuselage.\\n4. Therefore, the airline of this airplane is American Airlines.\"]", "time_sec": 66.497, "generation_time_seconds": 66.2718, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0002, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.51, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "526", "question": "What is make of this car?", "gt": "VOLVO; it is volvo; the make of the car is volvo", "pred": "1. The image displays the rear view of a white car.\n2. On the trunk lid, the word \"VOLVO\" is clearly written in the center.\n3. Below the Volvo logo, the model designation \"T5\" is visible.\n4. The combination of the logo and the name indicates the manufacturer.\n\nTherefore, the make of this car is Volvo.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The image displays the rear view of a white car.\n2. On the trunk lid, the word \"VOLVO\" is clearly written in the center.\n3. Below the Volvo logo, the model designation \"T5\" is visible.\n4. The combination of the logo and the name indicates the manufacturer.\n\nTherefore, the make of this car is Volvo.", "cot": "[\"1. The image displays the rear view of a white car.\\n2. On the trunk lid, the word \\\"VOLVO\\\" is clearly written in the center.\\n3. Below the Volvo logo, the model designation \\\"T5\\\" is visible.\\n4. The combination of the logo and the name indicates the manufacturer.\\n\\nTherefore, the make of this car is Volvo.\", \"1. The image shows the rear of a car.\\n2. On the trunk lid, there is a distinct emblem.\\n3. Above the emblem, the word \\\"VOLVO\\\" is written in capital letters.\\n4. The emblem itself is the classic Volvo logo.\\n5. Therefore, the make of the car is Volvo.\", \"Upon examining the image, we can clearly see the brand name \\\"VOLVO\\\" displayed in the center of the rear trunk lid of the car. This is the manufacturer's logo and name, indicating the make of the vehicle.\\n\\nTherefore, the make of this car is Volvo.\", \"I can see the car's trunk has a prominent logo. The logo clearly displays the word \\\"VOLVO\\\". This identifies the make of the vehicle.\\n\\nThe make of this car is Volvo.\"]", "time_sec": 48.97, "generation_time_seconds": 48.7927, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 26.32, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "533", "question": "How many people in the image are wearing glasses?", "gt": "Three of them have glasses on.; Three people are wearing glasses.; We can see three people wearing glasses.", "pred": "2", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Let's examine each person in the image to determine how many are wearing glasses:\n\n1.  The man on the far left, in a dark suit, is wearing glasses.\n2.  The man in the center, in a white shirt with a red shawl, is not wearing glasses.\n3.  The man on the far right, in a white shirt, is not wearing glasses.\n4.  The man in the dark suit in the middle is wearing glasses.\n\nTherefore, there are two people wearing glasses in the image.\n\nFinal answer: 2", "cot": "[\"Let's examine each person in the image to determine how many are wearing glasses:\\n\\n1.  The man on the far left, in a dark suit, is wearing glasses.\\n2.  The man in the center, in a white shirt with a red shawl, is not wearing glasses.\\n3.  The man on the far right, in a white shirt, is not wearing glasses.\\n4.  The man in the dark suit in the middle is wearing glasses.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two people wearing glasses in the image.\\n\\nFinal answer: 2\", \"By examining the image, we can observe the following:\\n\\n- The man on the far left is wearing glasses.\\n- The man on the far right is also wearing glasses.\\n- The other two individuals in the center are not wearing glasses.\\n\\nTherefore, there are two people wearing glasses in the image.\\n\\nFinal answer: 2\", \"There are two people wearing glasses in the image. One man on the far left is wearing glasses, and another man in the center, who is wearing a dark suit, is also wearing glasses.\", \"Let's examine the people in the image to determine how many are wearing glasses:\\n1.  The man on the far left is wearing glasses.\\n2.  The man in the red and white shawl is not wearing glasses.\\n3.  The man in the dark suit with a red tie is wearing glasses.\\n4.  The man on the far right is not wearing glasses.\\nTherefore, two people in the image are wearing glasses.\\n\\nFinal Answer: 2\"]", "time_sec": 60.78, "generation_time_seconds": 60.6407, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
