{"id": "540", "question": "What color are the flowers in the bottom right part of the image?", "gt": "Yellow.; The flowers in the bottom right part of the image are yellow.; The flowers are yellow.", "pred": "In the bottom right section of the image, there are clusters of flowers. Upon observing their color, they appear to be a pale, creamy yellow or beige.\n\nThe flowers in the bottom right part of the image are cream or beige.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "In the bottom right section of the image, there are clusters of flowers. Upon observing their color, they appear to be a pale, creamy yellow or beige.\n\nThe flowers in the bottom right part of the image are cream or beige.", "cot": "[\"In the bottom right section of the image, there are clusters of flowers. Upon observing their color, they appear to be a pale, creamy yellow or beige.\\n\\nThe flowers in the bottom right part of the image are cream or beige.\", \"In the bottom right portion of the image, the flowers are primarily green with some hints of yellow and brown, appearing to be in a later stage of blooming or starting to dry out.\", \"1. In the bottom right portion of the image, there are several clusters of flowers.\\n2. These flowers appear to be dried or have finished blooming.\\n3. The color of these dried flower clusters is a pale, beige-brown.\\n4. Therefore, the color of the flowers in the bottom right part of the image is beige-brown.\", \"By examining the bottom right portion of the image, we can see several clusters of flowers. These flowers are composed of many small florets, and their color is a pale, yellowish-white or cream hue. They appear somewhat dried or faded, but their base color is clearly in the light, off-white spectrum.\\n\\nTherefore, the flowers in the bottom right part of the image are cream-colored.\"]", "time_sec": 48.832, "generation_time_seconds": 48.6843, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 42.42, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "542", "question": "How many panes of glass are there in each tall window of the building?", "gt": "Four.; Each window has 4 panes of glass.; There are 4 panes of glass in each of the tall windows.", "pred": "The building has two tall, narrow windows on its side wall.\n Looking closely at each of these windows, we can see they are divided into multiple vertical sections by thin, dark frames.\n Counting these sections from the bottom to the top of one of the windows reveals there are six distinct vertical panes of glass in each window.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The building has two tall, narrow windows on its side wall.\n Looking closely at each of these windows, we can see they are divided into multiple vertical sections by thin, dark frames.\n Counting these sections from the bottom to the top of one of the windows reveals there are six distinct vertical panes of glass in each window.", "cot": "[\"The building has two tall, narrow windows on its side wall.\\n Looking closely at each of these windows, we can see they are divided into multiple vertical sections by thin, dark frames.\\n Counting these sections from the bottom to the top of one of the windows reveals there are six distinct vertical panes of glass in each window.\", \"The building has two tall, narrow windows on its visible side. Upon close inspection of the rightmost window, it is divided into multiple vertical sections by dark frames. Counting these sections reveals that there are six distinct panes of glass in that window. The leftmost window appears to be identical in design. Therefore, each tall window has six panes of glass.\", \"Based on the image provided, we can analyze the windows on the building.\\n\\n1.  The building has two tall, narrow windows that are visible.\\n2.  Each of these windows is a single, large pane of glass.\\n3.  There are no visible mullions or grilles dividing the glass into smaller sections.\\n\\nTherefore, each tall window has one pane of glass.\", \"1. The image displays a building with two tall, narrow windows.\\n2. Each of these windows is divided into multiple sections by vertical bars.\\n3. Counting the sections from the bottom to the top of one window reveals four distinct rectangular panes of glass.\"]", "time_sec": 55.046, "generation_time_seconds": 54.9017, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 30.19, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "543", "question": "What color is the cloth the girl is holding?", "gt": "It is white.; The cloth that the girl holds over her head is white.; The girl is holding a white cloth.", "pred": "The image shows a girl holding up a cloth. The visible part of the cloth is white. Therefore, the color of the cloth the girl is holding is white.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "The image shows a girl holding up a cloth. The visible part of the cloth is white. Therefore, the color of the cloth the girl is holding is white.", "cot": "[\"The image shows a girl holding up a cloth. The visible part of the cloth is white. Therefore, the color of the cloth the girl is holding is white.\", \"The girl in the image is holding a piece of cloth. This cloth is white. The girl is also wearing a white dress. The cloth is a white sheet.\\n\\nFinal Answer: White\", \"1. The image displays a tote bag with a printed photograph on it.\\n2. The photograph shows a young girl standing on a beach.\\n3. The girl is holding up a piece of cloth with both hands.\\n4. The cloth is light-colored, and under the bright sunlight, it appears to be white.\\nThe cloth the girl is holding is white.\", \"1. The image shows a girl holding a piece of cloth.\\n2. The cloth is being held up against a bright, sunny sky.\\n3. Due to the lighting and the way it is being held, the cloth appears to be white.\\nThe color of the cloth the girl is holding is white.\"]", "time_sec": 44.155, "generation_time_seconds": 44.0142, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 50.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "546", "question": "How many people are walking on the streets?", "gt": "Only one person can be seen walking on the streets.; There is one person noticeably walking.; 1", "pred": "Based on the provided aerial image, the streets and sidewalks are visible. After carefully examining these areas, there are no people visible walking on the streets.\n\nTherefore, the number of people walking on the streets is 0.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "Based on the provided aerial image, the streets and sidewalks are visible. After carefully examining these areas, there are no people visible walking on the streets.\n\nTherefore, the number of people walking on the streets is 0.", "cot": "[\"Based on the provided aerial image, the streets and sidewalks are visible. After carefully examining these areas, there are no people visible walking on the streets.\\n\\nTherefore, the number of people walking on the streets is 0.\", \"Based on a thorough examination of the image, there are no people visible walking on the streets or sidewalks.\", \"I have analyzed the image provided, which shows an aerial view of a neighborhood with houses, roads, and parked cars. I have carefully examined the streets and sidewalks visible in the image.\\n\\nAfter a thorough inspection of all the streets in the photograph, there are no people visible walking on them.\\n\\nTherefore, the number of people walking on the streets is 0.\", \"Based on a thorough analysis of the image provided, there are no visible people walking on the streets.\"]", "time_sec": 37.064, "generation_time_seconds": 36.8358, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "548", "question": "What color is the lanyard on the man in green?", "gt": "The lanyard is red.; Red; The lanyard on the neck of the man in green is red.", "pred": "1. The man in the green shirt is visible in the background of the image.\n2. Around his neck, he is wearing a lanyard.\n3. The color of this lanyard is yellow.\nTherefore, the lanyard on the man in green is yellow.", "group_key": "visual challenge", "sub_category": "visual challenge", "dataset": "haloquest", "method": "base_sc", "raw_output": "1. The man in the green shirt is visible in the background of the image.\n2. Around his neck, he is wearing a lanyard.\n3. The color of this lanyard is yellow.\nTherefore, the lanyard on the man in green is yellow.", "cot": "[\"1. The man in the green shirt is visible in the background of the image.\\n2. Around his neck, he is wearing a lanyard.\\n3. The color of this lanyard is yellow.\\nTherefore, the lanyard on the man in green is yellow.\", \"1. The man in the green shirt is located on the far left side of the image.\\n2. Around his neck, he is wearing a lanyard.\\n3. The lanyard is a distinct blue color.\\nTherefore, the lanyard on the man in green is blue.\", \"1. The man in the green shirt is standing in the background, behind the car.\\n2. He is wearing a white baseball cap.\\n3. A lanyard is visible around his neck.\\n4. The lanyard is yellow.\\n\\nThe color of the lanyard on the man in green is yellow.\", \"I have examined the man in the green shirt in the image. He is wearing a hat and a lanyard around his neck. The color of the lanyard is white.\\n\\nTherefore, the color of the lanyard on the man in green is white.\"]", "time_sec": 48.857, "generation_time_seconds": 48.7074, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 32.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
