n the background, primarily gathered around white tents. However, due to the distance and the focus of the photograph on the woman in the foreground, it is not possible to determine the exact number of people in the background.\"]", "time_sec": 54.93, "generation_time_seconds": 54.7622, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0003, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 23.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
